# Amalia Benavides Aguirre: "...destroy all other creatures if its power is exactly 20", and the ruling that her power "is checked only
# once, as the triggered ability resolves. If it is no longer on the battlefield at that point, use its power as it last existed on
# the battlefield" (CR 608.2h). Same build-up as the scenario where she stays: 20 power on turn 9. The Zuran Orb life gain
# triggers her; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 pays the ward (3 life) and exiles her with Swords to Plowshares. Bot1 gains 20 life
# (her power as it last was), but no trigger comes of it - she is gone. The trigger still resolves: she explores without being
# there (CR 701.44c; the Plains goes to hand, no counter can be put anywhere), her last power was 20, so every other creature is
# destroyed all the same.

